# Deny by default. Only the public tool and transported session formats are allowed.
*
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!docs/
!docs/**
!*.cmd
!*.ps1
!*.psd1
!Agents/
!Agents/*.psd1
!ACTIVE_HOST.txt
!Claude/
!Claude/**/
!Claude/**/*.jsonl
!ClaudeApp/
!ClaudeApp/**/
!ClaudeApp/**/*.json
# 앱이 대화를 지울 때 남기는 확장자 없는 삭제 마커. 이것이 운반되어야 한쪽에서 지운
# 대화가 반대편 Pull 때 되살아나지 않는다.
!ClaudeApp/**/deleted_*
!Codex/
!Codex/**/
!Codex/**/*.jsonl
!Codex/**/*.jsonl.gz
!Launchers/
!Launchers/**
Launchers/Shortcuts/*.lnk
!SESSION_MANIFEST.schema.md
!examples/
!examples/**

# Machine-local configuration must never be committed.
AgentSessionSync.config.psd1

# Explicit credential and local database blocks.
auth.json
config.toml
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.env
